[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i507"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一大早就来到诊所。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"径直走向苍和蓝的病房。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咔嚓。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“蓝。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“都不敲门吗，真没礼貌。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，对不起。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“还是说你在期待遇到什么幸运色狼事件？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1045"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1201"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“为什么呢，莫名地觉得你有点可恨。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“错觉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对了，苍呢……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1200"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“今天也很可爱。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这我知道。我问的是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1198"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在床上的苍，还是睡得和平时一样安稳。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，已经睡了足足两天了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“羽依里，苍至今有睡过那么长的时间吗……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“至少在我认识苍之后，从来没有发生过。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然断断续续地经常在睡觉，但最多也就1个小时左右。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"让蓝重新苏醒后安心了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"放下了身上的担子，所以也能安心的睡下。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"当然可以解释的像这样简单。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，却无法掩盖我们所畏惧的最坏的可能性。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍，差不多该起来了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“蓝也在等你哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而且，我们约好了的吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“找到蓝的记忆后，我们就正式交往。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……啥？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我正说到关键呢别插嘴啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“对不起。听到了我怎么也不能接受的词。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“不过……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“如果阿苍希望如此，也不是说完全没戏。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1201"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……让人怒愤填膺就是了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你睡了整整十年，倒是知道这么难的词汇啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1200"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“因为阿苍和我说了很多话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“有时候也会念书给我听。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“自己读了后觉得有趣的书。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“虽然，内容倾向也偏得可以。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“不过，那些书我也觉得很有趣。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“我醒过来后，能像这样普通地和人对话也全是多亏了她。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还真是舍己献身的睡眠学习呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1201"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“你用词也太肤浅了。应该说是至高无上的爱才对。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你的措辞也太沉重了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过，蓝果然是苍的姐妹呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……？双胞胎长得像不是当然的吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，不是说外表。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“只是说话的时候这么觉得。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然措辞和说话方式完全不一样，但却有和苍在说话的感觉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“…………是吗……”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1200"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“能被人这么说，我也挺开心的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“…………啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“莫非，你喜欢上我了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就是这样的地方很像苍啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1199"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“我已经有阿苍了，所以恕我不能和你交往。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为什么我都还没告白就被甩掉了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“不过，要是和阿苍一起的话，也不是完全没戏哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等等……真的假的，稍微等下……一起是指……唉？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……还，还真是够刺激的发言……我该怎么是好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我可是男校读书的，对这种的没有免疫力啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“搞不好可是要当真的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“……？我可是认真的哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“～～～～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“总之，我目前还是对苍是一心一意的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1200"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“那，我也目前是对阿苍一心一意的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不管怎么样，苍不起来的话说什么也没用。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1192"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1198"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“呼～…………呼～…………”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1202"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……哎嘿…味道，不一样的……刨冰……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真够悠哉的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"蓝","text":"“是啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两人一起注视着睡着了的苍。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明就在不久之前，我还和苍一起像这样注视着睡着的蓝。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]